@startuml state-diagram
title nautilus_zerodte - State Diagram (per-strategy lifecycle + SessionActor)

' Transition labels are the `reason` recorded by BaseZeroDteStrategy._transition and are
' therefore public API (hard rule 8). Renaming one is a breaking change, so this diagram
' names them verbatim rather than describing them.

[*] --> Flat

state Flat {
  Flat : no open position
  Flat : entries refused during SessionActor blackout
}

Flat --> Evaluating : signal

state Evaluating {
  Evaluating : build_intent, then the layered gates:\nedge, liquidity, regime, session,\noperational, greek
}

Evaluating --> Flat : no_intent
Evaluating --> Flat : gate_reject
Evaluating --> Flat : greek_reject
Evaluating --> Flat : dry_run
Evaluating --> PendingApproval : selector_queue\n(selector enabled)
Evaluating --> PendingEntry : submit\n(no selector)

state PendingApproval {
  PendingApproval : intent published on the bus,\nawaiting the SelectorActor
  PendingApproval : only reached when\nAppConfig.selector_enabled()
}

PendingApproval --> PendingEntry : submit\n(intent approved)
PendingApproval --> Flat : selector_reject

state PendingEntry {
  PendingEntry : order submitted, awaiting\nRiskEngine and venue acceptance
}

PendingEntry --> InPosition : entry_fill
PendingEntry --> Flat : order_rejected
PendingEntry --> Flat : order_denied

state InPosition {
  InPosition : monitor on_quote_tick\nand on_option_greeks
  InPosition : delta band breach -> hedge
}

InPosition --> Exiting : tp_sl
InPosition --> Exiting : session_blackout

state Exiting {
  Exiting : exit order submitted,\nawaiting the fill
}

Exiting --> Flat : exit_fill

Flat --> [*] : TradingNode stop

' SessionActor interaction (cross-cutting)
state "SessionActor" as SA {
  state "Normal" as SAN
  state "Blackout" as SAB
  SAN : new entries allowed
  SAB : T-30m to expiry\nnew entries blocked
  SAN --> SAB : minutes_to_expiry <= threshold
  SAB --> SAN : session reset / new expiry day
}

note right of Flat
  During blackout: Flat refuses entries;
  InPosition may still manage and flatten.
  Crypto: daily UTC expiry (for example 08:00).
  Equity: US market close (config overlay).
end note

note right of Evaluating
  No global batch cycle. Each Strategy owns
  its own state machine, and the default is
  no trade until every gate passes.
  Venue spread selection is delegated to
  strategies/selectors/ (Deribit | IB).

  `dry_run` leaves here for Flat, which is
  why defaulting it on would produce runs
  with gates passing and zero trades (D10).
end note

note bottom of PendingEntry
  flatten_positions() accepts PendingEntry,
  cancels the open orders, and does NOT
  transition. The state leaves PendingEntry
  only on a fill, a rejection or a denial.
end note

note bottom of Exiting
  NOT REACHABLE TODAY (ZR-36). flatten_positions
  calls self.cancel_all_orders() with no argument
  while NT 1.229.0 requires instrument_id
  positionally, so the only wired path into
  Exiting raises TypeError. Recorded as a strict
  xfail in tests/unit/test_flatten_path.py.
end note
@enduml
